# Inovance IS620N fault codes for the EMCY / 0x603F text (Phase 10.8, filled 9/10/2026).
# Load with: ecm_run ... --emcy-map config/emcy/is620n.emcy
#
# Names: "IS620N Series User Manual", chapter 5 Troubleshooting (Er.xxx).
# Mapping Er.XYZ -> 0x603F = 0x0XYZ: INFERRED from one real case and not
# stated in the manual -- W-06 / X-05 (9/10): 0x603F = 0x0E08 while the
# condition is Er.E08 "Synchronization loss" (drive in OP lost its process
# data / SYNC). A code that does not fit still shows its CiA 301 class.
# Notes from the manual for the EtherCAT codes:
#   Er.E08: abnormal frames, master sync problem, or OP -> non-OP while enabled;
#           tolerance 200C-24h "permissible interruption loss times of EtherCAT
#           synchronization" (default 9, range 4..20)
#   Er.E13: the sync cycle must be a multiple of 125 us or 250 us
#   Er.E15: sync cycle error above 200C-2Dh (default 500)
# Format: one "0xCODE text" per line after the vendor line.
vendor 0x00100000
0x0101 Er.101 Parameter abnormal
0x0102 Er.102 Programmable logic configuration fault
0x0103 Er.103 FPGA software version too early
0x0104 Er.104 Programmable logic interruption fault
0x0105 Er.105 Internal program abnormal
0x0108 Er.108 Parameter storage fault
0x0110 Er.110 Setting error of frequency-division pulse output
0x0111 Er.111 Servo drive internal parameter abnormal
0x0120 Er.120 Product model matching fault
0x0121 Er.121 Invalid S-ON command
0x0122 Er.122 Product matching fault in absolute position mode
0x0130 Er.130 Different DIs allocated with the same function
0x0131 Er.131 DO function No
0x0136 Er.136 Data check error or no parameter stored in the motor ROM
0x0200 Er.200 Overcurrent 1
0x0201 Er.201 Overcurrent 2
0x0207 Er.207 Shaft D/Q current overflow
0x0208 Er.208 FPGA sampling operation timeout
0x0210 Er.210 Output to-ground short-circuit
0x0220 Er.220 Phase sequence incorrect
0x0234 Er.234 Runaway
0x0400 Er.400 Main circuit overvoltage
0x0410 Er.410 Main circuit undervoltage
0x0420 Er.420 Main circuit phase loss
0x0430 Er.430 Control power undervoltage
0x0500 Er.500 Motor overspeed
0x0510 Er.510 Pulse output overspeed
0x0601 Er.601 Homing timeout
0x0602 Er.602 Angle auto-tuning failure
0x0610 Er.610 Servo drive overload
0x0620 Er.620 Motor overload
0x0630 Er.630 Motor rotor locked
0x0650 Er.650 Heatsink overheat
0x0730 Er.730 Encoder battery warning
0x0731 Er.731 Encoder battery failed
0x0733 Er.733 Encoder multi-turn counting error
0x0735 Er.735 Encoder multi-turn counting overflow
0x0740 Er.740 Encoder interference
0x0770 Er.770 External encoder scale fault
0x0900 Er.900 DI emergency braking
0x0909 Er.909 Motor overload warning
0x0920 Er.920 Regenerative resistor overload
0x0922 Er.922 Resistance of the external regenerative resistor too small
0x0939 Er.939 Motor power cable breaking
0x0941 Er.941 Parameter modification taking effect only after power-on again
0x0942 Er.942 Parameter storage too frequent
0x0950 Er.950 Positive limit switch warning
0x0952 Er.952 Negative limit switch warning
0x0980 Er.980 Encoder internal fault
0x0990 Er.990 Power input phase loss warning
0x0998 Er.998 Homing mode setting incorrect
0x0A33 Er.A33 Encoder data abnormal
0x0A34 Er.A34 Encoder communication check abnormal
0x0A35 Er.A35 Z signal lost
0x0A40 Er.A40 Motor auto-tuning failure
0x0B00 Er.B00 Position deviation excess
0x0B01 Er.B01 Position reference excess
0x0B02 Er.B02 Position deviation exceeding threshold in fully closed-loop
0x0B03 Er.B03 Electronic gear ratio setting exceeding limit
0x0B04 Er.B04 Parameter setting error with fully closed-loop function
0x0D09 Er.D09 Software upper/lower limit setting incorrect
0x0D10 Er.D10 Home offset setting incorrect
0x0E08 Er.E08 Synchronization loss (process data / SYNC lost at OP; seen 10.9 W-06 and X-05, no EMCY, the drive clears it back in OP)
0x0E11 Er.E11 The XML configuration file is not burnt
0x0E12 Er.E12 Network initialization failure
0x0E13 Er.E13 Synchronization cycle setting incorrect
0x0E15 Er.E15 Synchronization cycle error being large
